---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield, Cpu, Lock, Zap, Server, Globe } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Architecture & Philosophy - NovaTools"
  description="Learn about NovaTools, our mission to eliminate privacy risks in online file conversions, and our WebAssembly client-side runtime."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="space-y-2.5">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded border border-[#3FBE73]/30 bg-[#122D1F] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-[#3FBE73]">
        <Shield class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        <span>Local-First Engineering Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#ECEDEF]">
        High-Performance Media & Document Runtime
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#8B8F98] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Confidential financial records, medical records, private photos, and proprietary video footage should never travel across remote servers simply to be converted or compressed.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Mission & Problem Statement */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#331614] text-[#F0564B] border border-[#F0564B]/30">
          <Server class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF]">The Cloud Converter Problem</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8B8F98] leading-relaxed">
          Traditional web converters upload private documents to remote cloud infrastructure. 
          Even with deletion promises, files transit networks, sit in storage buckets, and risk exposure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#122D1F] text-[#3FBE73] border border-[#3FBE73]/30">
          <Cpu class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF]">The WebAssembly Solution</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8B8F98] leading-relaxed">
          NovaTools executes 100% of its workloads directly inside your browser sandbox. 
          By utilizing compiled <strong>WebAssembly (WASM)</strong> and WebCodecs, your device processes files at native speeds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Technical Core Pillars */}
    <section class="rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#ECEDEF]">Core Architectural Pillars</h2>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#16233F] text-[#4F8CFF] border border-[#4F8CFF]/30 mt-0.5">
            <Lock class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF]">Zero Server Transmission</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#8B8F98] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
              When you load a file into NovaTools, it is held in typed ArrayBuffers in local memory. No binary file payload ever leaves your device.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#122D1F] text-[#3FBE73] border border-[#3FBE73]/30 mt-0.5">
            <Zap class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF]">Direct Hardware Acceleration</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#8B8F98] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
              Zero network queues or server-side throttling. Transcoding and calculations occur across client CPU and GPU cores in parallel.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#1B1D22] text-[#8B8F98] border border-[#2A2D33] mt-0.5">
            <Globe class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF]">Offline Capable & Sovereign</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#8B8F98] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
              Because workloads execute locally, tools function even in restricted environments, on airplanes, or in air-gapped workstations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Contact CTA */}
    <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-[#8B8F98] font-mono">
      Questions or bug reports? <a href="/contact" class="text-[#4F8CFF] hover:underline">Open a ticket</a>.
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
